Workstream ID: tutorial-and-help
Title: Isolated interactive tutorial and usable Help reference
Status: DONE
Milestone: Learn every implemented workflow without changing real progress
Dependencies: tracker-foundation, versioned-roadmaps, career-graph
GitHub issue: https://github.com/Zanark/CareerOS/issues/6
Purpose: Record comprehensive guided practice and searchable reference, distinct
  from running a user's actual mission, importing history or granting learning credit.

Tasks:
  [x] Use isolated in-memory practice with real controls and state-derived gates.
  [x] Add clear highlights, moving hand cues and movable accessible coaching.
  [x] Cover full maps, evidence, backups, adoption, focus and graph controls.
  [x] Preserve compact/landscape instruction visibility and manual map collapse.
  [x] Provide 19 expandable searchable Help topics with useful navigation links.
  [x] Keep real workspace, preference and focus-session ownership separate.

Acceptance criteria:
  Tutorial contains 150 lessons across 28 chapters covering implemented workflows.
  Exit/restart discards practice rather than restoring an old personal snapshot.
  Help headings actually expand and links navigate without recording progress.
  New encrypted journal remains disabled in practice and uses its separate guide.

Completion evidence:
  Retrospective authored: 2026-11-06.
  Public revisions: b7ae40d, dad930d, adafb54, 9fe0cfd, 78e0732 and e42528e.
  Maintained behavior: docs/GUIDE.md, docs/ARCHITECTURE.md; src/tutorial.
  Historical successful browser gate:
    https://github.com/Zanark/CareerOS/actions/runs/41529974393 at 9b2903b.
  Human acceptance: user learning or tutorial completion is not inferred.
  Publication: implementation public; no tutorial/source edits in this migration.
  Limitations: historical browser qualification, not a tutorial run performed today.

Completion log:
  2026-10-04 - Published isolated practice, visual guidance and movable coach.
  2026-10-07 - Published expanded graph guidance and functional Help reference.
  2026-11-03 - Encrypted journal addition preserved tutorial isolation.
  2026-11-06 - Recorded public behavior/evidence without manufacturing user progress.
